due its prey or kill it, either smashing it with its body, spraying external digestion acid or b\iting it. </span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 661.81 516.439 705.921]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj90 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Collective Motor Coordination - With the aid of the dormant body, the awakened body can use their weight to move quickly in enviroments like water, also evading enemy attacks. )/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920195551-03'00')/NM(844ec8dc96c74e098e212ff672c9ebf7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Collective Motor Coordination - With the aid of the dormant body, the awakened body can use their weight to move quickly in enviroments like water, al\so evading enemy attacks. </span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 574.101 513.166 618.722]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj91 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Immobilize - With its tentacles, the creature can constrict the prey into submission, or can jump on top of it and bite its body, latching onto it and blocking its movement for a while \(equivalent time to 2 turns\). )/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920195725-03'00')/NM(c91dd0727aea4492802a48e2eeb56f21)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-